line", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/allopatry/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 544, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 386, "last_played": 1428286919, "avatar": "757b0e03889ed309466483459a37af8b6402219a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Alienssssss...\nThis is a fun game *if* you have people to play it with. In that case, it's a great... uh... \"team building\" exercise. That is to say you should be prepared for frustrating moments. The frustration makes success that much more rewarding however. I and the person I'm playing with discovered that you can't effectively advance beyond about 2/3 of the game without a party of four players. It's a shame you can't mix and match CPU players with human players because this caused me to put the game down. Creative and fun!", "timestamp_created": 1355570399, "timestamp_updated": 1355570399, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1046209", "author": {"steamid": "76561197985219898", "personaname": "Sol™", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TheSolStream/", "num_games_owned": 803, "num_reviews": 135, "playtime_forever": 70, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 70, "last_played": 1355558400, "avatar": "087b135a4bd481d83580d792659a15fff894b25f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Can't get a better price than free! And the game itself is actually pretty good.", "timestamp_created": 1355532143, "timestamp_updated": 1355532143, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_st